 HISTORY                                                            84 1451
 -------                                                            84 1451
 This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction Physics    84 1451
 (LEIP) group at NC State University, USA. The inelastic            84 1451
 scattering thermal scattering law data for UO2 were developed      84 1451
 using ab intio lattice dynamics methods [1,2]. The Full Law        84 1451
 Analysis Scattering System Hub (FLASSH) code was used to           84 1451
 produce File 7 MT=2 and 4 for U in UO2 and O in UO2 [3]. MAT=84    84 1451
 and ZA=184 were used for U in UO2 (100% enrichment).               84 1451
                                                                    84 1451
